face-image: img/portraits/Yes_Tuesday.png

= The Party Secretary

The Party Secretary of the <span style="color: #aa0f24;">**RGA**</span> oversees all internal party mechanisms. Until now, Yes Tuesday, the founder of our party, has provisionally filled the roles. 

Now that the party has grown, it is time to democratically elect a party secretary.

The candidates are as follows:

Embarrassed Owl, a member of the pan-socialist camp, although with some reformist sympathies.

CocoLenin, a broad socialist of the non-authoritarian kind, such as anarchists, libertarian socialists and democratic socialists.

Sionivese, a libertarian socialist with anarchist sympathies.

While the position of party secretary is a largely unpolitical one, their sympathies may still somewhat influence our party line.

- @embarrassed: We will elect Embarrassed Owl.
- @cocolenin: We will elect CocoLenin.
- @sionivese: We will elect Sionivese.
- @arcticsummertime: What about a Marxist candidate...?

@embarrassed
subtitle: This will slightly strengthen the Pan-Socialists. This will slightly strengthen the Reformists.
on_arrival: pansocialist_strength += 5; reformist_strength += 5

Embarrassed Owl has been elected to the position of Party Secretary. Now, his task is to prepare our first party congress, scheduled for tomorrow.

